# ── Supabase (backend for 1v1 duels) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Create a free project at https://supabase.com, then copy from
# Project Settings → API. Both values are safe to expose in the browser
# (the anon key is protected by Row Level Security — see GAMIFICATION_PROPOSAL.md).
#
# Copy this file to `.env` for local dev, and set the same two variables in
# Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables for production.
# The game runs fully offline/local-only when these are unset.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-ANON-PUBLIC-KEY
